# UI Design System — follow DESIGN.md

Source of truth: [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md). Before creating or editing UI, read relevant sections and map surfaces to documented tokens.

## Theme by surface

| App surface | Theme | Canvas |
|-------------|-------|--------|
| Dashboard, sidebar, tables, ledger | Dark (default) | `#0b0e11` |
| Forms: sessions, transactions, settings, login | Light (transactional) | `#ffffff` |

Do not mix themes within one screen. Yellow CTAs work on both.

## Required color tokens

Use CSS variables or Tailwind theme mapped to DESIGN.md — never ad-hoc hex outside this set:

```
primary: #fcd535          on-primary: #181a20
primary-active: #f0b90b   primary-disabled: #3a3a1f
canvas-dark: #0b0e11      canvas-light: #ffffff
surface-card-dark: #1e2329 surface-elevated-dark: #2b3139
surface-soft-light: #fafafa
body: #eaecef             body-on-light / ink: #181a20
muted: #707a8a            on-dark: #ffffff
hairline-on-dark: #2b3139 hairline-on-light: #eaecef
trading-up: #0ecb81       trading-down: #f6465d
info-ring: #3b82f6
```

## Typography

- **Copy** (labels, nav, body): BinanceNova → fallback `Inter, system-ui, sans-serif`
- **Money & numbers** (VND, balances, stats): BinancePlex → fallback `"JetBrains Mono", "IBM Plex Sans", monospace`
- Page title: 24px/600 · Section title: 20px/600 · Body: 14px/400 · Button: 14px/600
- Large fund stats: 40px/700 in number font

## Spacing & radius

- Base unit 4px. Card padding: 24px. Section gaps: 80px. Nav height: 64px.
- Buttons/inputs: `rounded-md` (6px). Cards: `rounded-xl` (12px). Pill CTAs: `rounded-full`.

## Component mapping (B15 app)

| UI element | DESIGN.md component |
|------------|---------------------|
| Sidebar / app shell | `top-nav-dark` on `canvas-dark` |
| Summary stat cards | `stat-callout-card` (yellow numbers) or `trust-badge` |
| Data tables (sessions, transactions, ledger) | `markets-table-card` + `markets-row` |
| Positive balance / surplus | `price-up-cell` (`trading-up` text) |
| Negative balance / owes money | `price-down-cell` (`trading-down` text) |
| Primary action (Lưu, Tạo, Đăng nhập) | `button-primary` — yellow bg, `#181a20` text |
| Secondary / cancel | `button-secondary-on-dark` or `button-secondary-on-light` |
| Delete / destructive row action | keep destructive semantics; do not use `trading-down` bg |
| Form inputs on light pages | `text-input-on-light` |
| Search/filter on dark pages | `search-input-on-dark` |
| Dashboard chart container | `price-chart-card` pattern on dark card surface |

## Do

- Use `trading-up` / `trading-down` for ledger +/- amounts only (text color, not card bg).
- Keep primary yellow scarce — CTAs, key stats, active nav highlight.
- Use flat surfaces + hairline borders; no glassmorphism or heavy shadows.
- Format VND with number font; labels with body font.

## Don't

- Don't use green `#16a34a` or generic shadcn defaults when DESIGN tokens exist.
- Don't put white text on yellow buttons (`on-primary` is dark ink).
- Don't use `trading-up`/`trading-down` for non-financial success/error toasts.
- Don't add gradients except documented hero bands (not used in app dashboard).
- Don't introduce a second brand accent color.

## Implementation check

When changing UI, verify:

1. Colors match DESIGN.md tokens (not hardcoded unrelated palette).
2. Dashboard/sidebar = dark; forms = light.
3. Money columns use number typography.
4. Primary buttons = yellow + dark text, 40px height, 6px radius.
5. Tables sit on `#1e2329` cards with `#2b3139` dividers.

If DESIGN.md and existing code conflict, update code to match DESIGN.md and centralize tokens in `src/app/globals.css`.
